  ],
  "conflict_rules": [
    "Applicable binding law prevails over non-binding standards and ANK policy.",
    "An AU or regional instrument is treated as binding only after jurisdictional applicability is verified.",
    "Where multiple non-binding controls apply, retain the stricter safety/privacy/security control unless it conflicts with binding law.",
    "African requirements are first-class inputs and may not be silently replaced by US, EU or other foreign defaults.",
    "A draft, withdrawn, superseded or historical instrument may inform research but may not be represented as current binding authority.",
    "A standard whose full text is licensed may be indexed by public metadata only until ANK holds a lawful licence or other permission for the intended use."
  ],
